{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based card game with a mobile gacha style. You can obtain better equipment through combat and casual gameplay, accumulate sufficient resources to draw powerful characters of your choice, and form a strong lineup to defeat even stronger enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each equipment has unique entries and random attributes, and powerful equipment in the later stages can be inlaid with gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >role</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For every completed chapter, you will receive one free character of your choice. Daily check-ins and level rewards offer numerous chances to draw cards, with a guaranteed reward mechanism in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strengthen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The equipment can be enhanced up to 15 times with a 100% success rate. Each enhancement will increase the basic attributes of the equipment, and every three levels of enhancement will randomly grant a term, full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Acquisition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily check-ins, level rewards, online rewards (which are fully earned after 30 minutes), and dungeons all provide access to resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Thanks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plugins: Yanfly Engine Plugins, Weak Little C (Little C Knows Nothing), gt50, Yuhang</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947300?t=1759793912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947300?t=1759793912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947300/c4c1489b470a76df002e7e8720c887fa66c72f04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759793912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947300/c4c1489b470a76df002e7e8720c887fa66c72f04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759793912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based card game with a mobile gacha style. You can obtain better equipment through combat and casual gameplay, accumulate sufficient resources to draw powerful characters of your choice, and form a strong lineup to defeat even stronger enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each equipment has unique entries and random attributes, and powerful equipment in the later stages can be inlaid with gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >role</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For every completed chapter, you will receive one free character of your choice. Daily check-ins and level rewards offer numerous chances to draw cards, with a guaranteed reward mechanism in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strengthen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The equipment can be enhanced up to 15 times with a 100% success rate. Each enhancement will increase the basic attributes of the equipment, and every three levels of enhancement will randomly grant a term, full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Acquisition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily check-ins, level rewards, online rewards (which are fully earned after 30 minutes), and dungeons all provide access to resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Thanks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plugins: Yanfly Engine Plugins, Weak Little C (Little C Knows Nothing), gt50, Yuhang</p>","developers":["Sora"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947300/d464f99afaa125cc5f7c60a195932397cca6dfe9/header.jpg?t=1759793912","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"